    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e3bd24f1_d63ada18",
        "filename": "src/services/rmmd/manifest.rs",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 151,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000043
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-10T15:25:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should this rather be a usize?\n\nAccording to RF-A code style guide [1]:\n\u003e usize and isize are the Rust types for values that will become pointers, sequence indices, and memory object counts.\n\u003e \n\u003e u32, i32, u64, and i64 are the right types for other register values, bit fields and bit masks, and other integer values.\n\n[1] https://git.trustedfirmware.org/plugins/gitiles/RF-A/rusted-firmware-a/+/refs/heads/main/docs/style-guide.md#using-the-primitive-integral-types",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 151,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 151,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "03668d004fca88bca81dfbe23dac78401ea38f1b",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "179d334f_b5ae7dd2",
        "filename": "src/services/rmmd/manifest.rs",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 199,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000043
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-10T15:25:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we need to make this assumption (I see it here and in `layout.rs`, `rmmd.rs`, ...)? The RMM Boot Manifest has to fit in the RMM/EL3 shared buffer but is there anything preventing the latter from being bigger than a page? Does TF-A make that assumption too?\n\nIf there is a good reason for this restriction, then could we enforce that in the type of `buf`? changing from the current array of bytes type to array of 1024 bytes type? Or even defining a new struct type for a page-sized buffer which embeds the page alignment restriction.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 199,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 199,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "03668d004fca88bca81dfbe23dac78401ea38f1b",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
    },
